---
const stages = [
  ['Attention', 'r₁：元の入力を残す', 'Attention出力'],
  ['MLP / SwiGLU', 'r₂：合流後の入力を残す', 'MLP出力'],
];
---

<figure class="residual-diagram" aria-label="Residualの分岐と合流">
  <figcaption>Residual：処理する枝と、入力を残す枝が合流する</figcaption>
  <div class="residual-circuit">
    {stages.map(([name, residual, output]) => (
      <div class="residual-stage">
        <div class="residual-bypass">
          <span>{residual}</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span>
        </div>
        <div class="residual-main">
          <strong>入力 x</strong>
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          <span>RMSNorm</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          <strong>{name}</strong>
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          <span class="residual-sum">
            <b>＋</b>
            <small>入力と{output}</small>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p>[B,T,1024]の形を保ち、加算後の表現を次の処理へ渡す。</p>
</figure>
